# Markdown — only the root README.md is pushed to GitHub.
# Everything else (docs/**, including every nested README.md under
# docs/guideline, docs/srs, docs/architecture, docs/database, docs/api,
# docs/ui-ux, docs/development-plan, docs/decisions, docs/bn, ...) stays
# local-only. `*.md` matches by filename at any depth; the `!/README.md`
# negation re-includes only the one at the repo root.
*.md
!/README.md
